<h1 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333333; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Your account has been deleted</h1>

<div style="color: #51545E; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.625;">
  <p>
    As you asked, your PreTeXt.Plus account (<%= @user.email %>) has been deleted.
    Your public profile and published outputs are no longer available.
  </p>
  <p>
    On <strong><%= @user.purge_at.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></strong>, your account and
    all of your projects, including every file uploaded to them, will be permanently
    deleted. They cannot be recovered after that.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you change your mind before then, sign in to reactivate your account. Everything
    will be exactly as you left it.
  </p>
  <p style="text-align: center; margin: 32px 0;">
    <a href="<%= new_user_session_url %>" style="background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Sign in to reactivate</a>
  </p>
  <p>
    If you didn't delete your account, sign in and reactivate it right away, then change
    your password.
  </p>
</div>

<table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #EAEAEC;">
  <tr>
    <td style="font-size: 13px; color: #6B6E76; text-align: center;">
      You are receiving this because you deleted your account on
      <a href="https://pretext.plus" style="color: #3869D4;">PreTeXt.Plus</a>.
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
